The best people are those that make you smile more often - Steven Paul Jobs

This is just one of more than 20,000 quotations from our collection of quotes said by famous people. Very often we have a need to say something clever but it's difficult to find the right words.

Our app allows you to:

- Speak beautiful and elegant;
- Find appropriated quotes for status in social networks;
- Lift the mood and increase knowledge;

Despite such a great number of citations, you can always find what you want right now. You have only to start searching and the program will prompt all key words or authors.

You can add any quote to your favorites list. Also you have the opportunity to share quotes with friends using VKontakte , Facebook, Twitter and Mail.

Full list of features:

- Support for all possible extensions - iPhone, iPhone 5 and iPad;
- Design optimization for iOS 7 as well as full support for older versions;
- View citations do not require an Internet connection;
- Search quotes by key words and author;
- The ability to view quotes in random order;
- Daily quote - new quotes every day;
- Go to navigation by key words and author;
- Statistics of viewed quotes;
- The possibility to add quotes to favorites;
- The opportunity to share quotes via VKontakte , Facebook, Twitter;
- The possibility of delivery using Mail;
- Copy to clipboard;
- Simple and enjoyable for reading design;

